@startuml
!theme plain
|a_default| DMS Parts Provision Team
|a_default|
start
:gather information about part from customer (make  model  year);
:check availability of part in local inventory;
:v1: check availability of part in local inventory ({Available locally, Not available locally}); <<objectSignal>>
if () then ([v1 = 'Available locally'])
:retrieve part from local inventory;
stop
else ([v1 = 'Not available locally'])
:record customer details;
:order part from Disuki;
stop
endif
@enduml